# NovaHash

NovaHash is a lightweight Python utility for generating SHA256 hashes from text or files.

## Features

- Fast SHA256 hashing
- File hashing
- Text hashing
- No external dependencies
- Cross platform

## Installation

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/NovaHash.git
cd NovaHash
```

## Usage

Hash text

```bash
python novahash.py --text "Hello World"
```

Hash a file

```bash
python novahash.py --file document.pdf
```

